# 🚦 Gridlock Traffic Demand Prediction

## 📌 Overview
This project predicts traffic demand using machine learning techniques on spatio-temporal traffic data. The solution combines advanced feature engineering with multiple gradient boosting models and ensemble learning techniques to improve prediction accuracy.

The final pipeline includes:
- LightGBM
- CatBoost
- XGBoost
- Weighted Ensembling
- Stacking (Ridge Regression Meta Model)

---
## 🎯 Objective
Predict future traffic demand based on:
- Location (Geohash)
- Timestamp
- Weather conditions
- Road characteristics
- Vehicle information
- Nearby landmarks

The goal is to maximize prediction accuracy while maintaining a reproducible and scalable ML pipeline.
---

