# 📈 Results Summary

| Model | CV Score |
|---------|---------|
| LightGBM | 95.61 |
| CatBoost | 95.34 |
| XGBoost | 95.61 |
| Triple Ensemble | 95.84 |
| Stacking | 95.79 |
Best Local Validation Score:
```text
95.84
```
